    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45A(3) Parliamentary Budget Office documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012#sch-1-sec-45a-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A document is an exempt document to the extent that it contains\ninformation the disclosure of which would reveal that a\nconfidential request has been made to the Parliamentary Budget\nOfficer or the Parliamentary Budget Office, unless the existence of\nthe request has been disclosed by the Senator or Member of the\nHouse of Representatives who made the request.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00177\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nExceptions",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A document is an exempt document to the extent that it contains\ninformation the disclosure of which would reveal that a\nconfidential request has been made to the Parliamentary Budget\nOfficer or the Parliamentary Budget Office, unless the existence of\nthe request has been disclosed by the Senator or Member of the\nHouse of Representatives who made the request.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00177\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nExceptions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "70294cdf949154e2c5538b7886f69eaac1c679216b6e947e84f2b2193d4d7c93",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of confidential request information is restricted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012#sch-1-sec-45a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45A(3) Parliamentary Budget Office documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A document is an exempt document to the extent that it contains\ninformation the disclosure of which would reveal that a\nconfidential request has been made to the Parliamentary Budget\nOfficer or the Parliamentary Budget Office, unless the existence of\nthe request has been disclosed by the Senator or Member of the\nHouse of Representatives who made the request.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00177\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nExceptions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Restrict",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Restricts disclosure of confidential information.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Confidential request made to Parliamentary Budget Officer.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Disclosure of request information is restricted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45A(4) Parliamentary Budget Office documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012#sch-1-sec-45a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A document is not an exempt document only because it is attached\nto a document to which subsection (1), (2) or (3) applies.\nNote:\nHowever, the attachment itself may be an exempt document.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A document is not an exempt document only because it is attached\nto a document to which subsection (1), (2) or (3) applies.\nNote:\nHowever, the attachment itself may be an exempt document.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "75660bcb65db14ba42ac0348c7a58a354542c84687abfdbf9d4080eb831f6e97",
      "skos:note": "A document is not exempt solely because it is attached to another exempt document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012#sch-1-sec-45a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45A(4) Parliamentary Budget Office documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A document is not an exempt document only because it is attached\nto a document to which subsection (1), (2) or (3) applies.\nNote:\nHowever, the attachment itself may be an exempt document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-parliamentary-budget-office-act-2012-sch-1-sec-45a-ss-4"
