      "values:originalText": "Omit “or 34 (Cabinet documents)”, substitute “, 34 (Cabinet\ndocuments) or 45A (Parliamentary Budget Office documents)”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00177\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\n6            Freedom of Information Amendment (Parliamentary Budget Office) Act 2012       No.\n177, 2012",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “or 34 (Cabinet documents)”, substitute “, 34 (Cabinet\ndocuments) or 45A (Parliamentary Budget Office documents)”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00177\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\n6            Freedom of Information Amendment (Parliamentary Budget Office) Act 2012       No.\n177, 2012",
